<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus Jan-Oct 96 trade deficit widens eight pct.</title>
<headline>Cyprus Jan-Oct 96 trade deficit widens eight pct.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cyprus's trade deficit rose eight percent in the 10 months from January to October 1996 compared with the same period of 1995, the Department of Statistics said on Wednesday in a press release.</p>
<p>Imports rose to 1,549.0 million pounds ($3.12 billion) from 1,387.9 million in the same period of 1995, and exports to 540 million from 453.0 million. ($=0.49 pounds)</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
